{:edb/db-before-t 394 :edb/db-after-t 395 :edb/tx-data [[13194139533707 50 #inst "2026-10-04T17:52:27.818Z" 13194139533707 true] [17592186096761 1020 #edb/ref 17592186247745 13194139533707 true] [17592186096761 1020 #edb/ref 17592186247752 13194139533707 true] [17592186096761 1020 #edb/ref 17592186247756 13194139533707 true] [17592186096762 1020 #edb/ref 17592186247759 13194139533707 true] [17592186096762 1020 #edb/ref 17592186247763 13194139533707 true] [17592186247745 1017 #edb/ref 17592186247746 13194139533707 true] [17592186247745 1089 "q-107360" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247745 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533707 true] [17592186247745 1100 "Find the slope of the tangent to the curve $y=\\sqrt{1-4x}$ at the point where $x=-2.$" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247745 1113 #uuid "d088e2f4-98bd-51ca-b324-ad0066961fab" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247745 1138 false 13194139533707 true] [17592186247745 1145 "To find the slope at a given point, we have to find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ at that point.\n\nWe use the chain rule in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}.\n$$\n\nLet $u=1-4x.$ Then $y=\\sqrt{u}.$ Differentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}u}=\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{u}}\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=-4.\n$$\n\nMultiplying the two together gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{u}}\\cdot (-4) \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1-4x}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting $x=-2,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=-2} & ={(-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1-4x}})|}_{x=-2} \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1-4(-2)}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{3}\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247746 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247747 13194139533707 true] [17592186247746 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247748 13194139533707 true] [17592186247746 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247749 13194139533707 true] [17592186247746 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247750 13194139533707 true] [17592186247746 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247751 13194139533707 true] [17592186247746 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533707 true] [17592186247746 1041 "selection" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247746 1104 #edb/ref 17592186247749 13194139533707 true] [17592186247746 1110 #uuid "4271b4ea-d411-5043-8d9d-17669ba4688e" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247747 1034 "-\\frac{5}{3}" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247747 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533707 true] [17592186247747 1111 #uuid "c6f4b802-aef0-57ce-8c54-825536e1090f" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247748 1034 "-\\frac{3}{4}" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247748 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533707 true] [17592186247748 1111 #uuid "05322057-8b0e-56bb-81ec-0970aa594e51" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247749 1034 "-\\frac{2}{3}" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247749 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533707 true] [17592186247749 1111 #uuid "9d1a260e-a31b-5401-9a89-2e7d9261b893" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247750 1034 "2" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247750 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533707 true] [17592186247750 1111 #uuid "ddfc82f7-0ca2-5268-bdae-7aa98b4b447d" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247751 1034 "\\frac{1}{3}" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247751 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533707 true] [17592186247751 1111 #uuid "c5aa7d8b-faf1-5256-bf64-f931a0790b86" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247752 1017 #edb/ref 17592186247753 13194139533707 true] [17592186247752 1089 "q-342680" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247752 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139533707 true] [17592186247752 1100 "Given that $y=\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-6x}$, find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}.$\n\n$\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247752 1113 #uuid "7df4d434-8d33-5d38-aa4e-4d3877f594d6" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247752 1138 false 13194139533707 true] [17592186247752 1145 "We use the chain rule in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}.\n$$\n\nLet $u={x}^{2}-6x.$ Then $y=\\sqrt{u}.$ Differentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}u}=\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{u}},\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=2x-6.\n$$\n\nMultiplying the two together gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{u}}\\cdot (2x-6) \\\\  & =\\frac{2(x-3)}{2\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-6x}} \\\\  & =\\frac{x-3}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-6x}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247753 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247754 13194139533707 true] [17592186247753 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247755 13194139533707 true] [17592186247753 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533707 true] [17592186247753 1041 "field-1" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247753 1104 #edb/ref 17592186247754 13194139533707 true] [17592186247753 1110 #uuid "3ce5253c-a2dd-5405-ae23-b94286e309cf" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247754 1034 "\\frac{x-3}{\\sqrt{x^2-6x}}" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247754 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533707 true] [17592186247754 1111 #uuid "2ce307e5-e22e-5d90-96e6-f0348515a033" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247755 1034 "2x-6" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247755 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533707 true] [17592186247755 1111 #uuid "84308f97-9abd-5b9d-913b-85c40ca9e5a5" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247756 1017 #edb/ref 17592186247757 13194139533707 true] [17592186247756 1089 "q-342764" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247756 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533707 true] [17592186247756 1100 "Find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for $y=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5x+1}}.$\n\n$\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247756 1113 #uuid "f410e62b-fbc6-55dc-baa4-c0ee039c46d3" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247756 1138 false 13194139533707 true] [17592186247756 1145 "We use the chain rule in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}.\n$$\n\nLet $u=5x+1.$ Then $y=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u}}={u}^{-1/2}.$ Differentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}u}=-\\frac{1}{2}{u}^{-3/2}=-\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{{u}^{3}}},\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=5.\n$$\n\nMultiplying the two together gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =-\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{{u}^{3}}}\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =-\\frac{5}{2\\sqrt{{u}^{3}}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{5}{2\\sqrt{(5x+1)^{3}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247757 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247758 13194139533707 true] [17592186247757 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533707 true] [17592186247757 1041 "field-1" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247757 1104 #edb/ref 17592186247758 13194139533707 true] [17592186247757 1110 #uuid "ec56b9fd-282c-517f-b467-4c1ed9b89331" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247758 1034 "-\\frac{5}{2(5x+1)\\sqrt{5x+1}}" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247758 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533707 true] [17592186247758 1111 #uuid "5cc49d45-6162-51f3-8a8e-bd0382d5fa13" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247759 1017 #edb/ref 17592186247760 13194139533707 true] [17592186247759 1089 "q-342875" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247759 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139533707 true] [17592186247759 1100 "Given that $f(x)={({x}^{5}-4{x}^{4})}^{2},$ find ${f}^{′}(x).$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=2({x}^{5}-4{x}^{4})($\n{{field-1}}\n$)$" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247759 1113 #uuid "51a9f7ec-b27f-5953-a72f-6724c13f116d" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247759 1138 false 13194139533707 true] [17592186247759 1145 "Let $g(x)={x}^{5}-4{x}^{4}$ and $f(g(x))=g(x)^{2}.$ \n\nDifferentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(g(x)) & =({g}^{2})^{′}=2g, \\\\ {g}^{′}(x) & =({x}^{5}-4{x}^{4})^{′}=5{x}^{4}-16{x}^{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, using the chain rule, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & ={f}^{′}(g(x))\\cdot {g}^{′}(x) \\\\  & =2g\\cdot (5{x}^{4}-16{x}^{3}) \\\\  & =2({x}^{5}-4{x}^{4})(\\,5{x}^{4}-16{x}^{3}\\,).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247760 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247761 13194139533707 true] [17592186247760 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247762 13194139533707 true] [17592186247760 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533707 true] [17592186247760 1041 "field-1" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247760 1104 #edb/ref 17592186247762 13194139533707 true] [17592186247760 1110 #uuid "e6f3f48d-e24a-53c3-b195-5cc40828ce93" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247761 1034 "5x^4-4x^3" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247761 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533707 true] [17592186247761 1111 #uuid "c69c435d-ccdc-5192-8a16-746d3a6ba186" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247762 1034 "5x^4-16x^3" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247762 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533707 true] [17592186247762 1111 #uuid "2450036d-1de1-555d-a0a4-2d4d5b43cd86" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247763 1017 #edb/ref 17592186247764 13194139533707 true] [17592186247763 1089 "q-342883" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247763 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139533707 true] [17592186247763 1100 "Given that $f(x)=\\sqrt{5x-4},$ find ${f}^{′}(x).$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247763 1113 #uuid "fec3c3e3-95f5-51f8-a1cd-c18f8ec4257f" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247763 1138 false 13194139533707 true] [17592186247763 1145 "Let $g(x)=5x-4$ and $f(g(x))=\\sqrt{g(x)}.$ \n\nDifferentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(g(x)) & ={(\\sqrt{g})}^{′}=\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{g}}, \\\\ {g}^{′}(x) & =(5x-4)^{′}=5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, using the chain rule, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & ={f}^{′}(g(x))\\cdot {g}^{′}(x) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{g}}\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2\\sqrt{5x-4}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247764 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247765 13194139533707 true] [17592186247764 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533707 true] [17592186247764 1041 "field-1" 13194139533707 true] [17592186247